Fixes: 9f8f93bee3ef ("drm/xe: Emit a render cache flush after each rcs/ccs batch")
Reported-by: Lionel Landwerlin <lionel.g.landwerlin@intel.com>
Closes: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/drm/xe/kernel/-/issues/8909
